> {% client.global.set("couponId", response.body.id); %}

### 쿠폰 발급 (사용자 7)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/coupons/{{couponId}}/issue
X-User-Id: 7

> {% client.global.set("issuedCouponId", response.body.id); %}

### 쿠폰 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/coupons/{{couponId}}

### 같은 사용자로 다시 발급 (409 예상)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/coupons/{{couponId}}/issue
X-User-Id: 7

### 쿠폰 목록 확인
GET http://localhost:8080/api/issued-coupons
X-User-Id: 7

### 쿠폰 사용 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/issued-coupons/{{issuedCouponId}}/use
X-User-Id: 7

### 쿠폰 사용 취소
POST http://localhost:8080/api/issued-coupons/{{issuedCouponId}}/cancel
X-User-Id: 7
